# [Project Name]

## Claude Code

This project uses Claude Code with the global rules and skills from the agent configuration repo. Project-specific rules in this file override global defaults when they conflict.

Workspace facts live in `WORKSPACE.md`. Read that file for factual local commands, generated paths, diagnostics, and safety constraints before planning or running project commands. When `.agent/scripts/project-diagnostics.py` exists, use `--list` to discover checks and `--check <name>` to run the specific check needed. That script is a shared symlink from the agent configuration repo, so record project-specific checks in `WORKSPACE.md` rather than editing the script. Current work belongs in `PROGRESS.md` at the project root when a multi-session plan is active.

